# Native Homebrew bundle. This is now a PARTIAL Brewfile: plain homebrew/core
# CLI formulae were migrated to mise's experimental brew bootstrap and live in
# config/mise/conf.d/brew/ under [bootstrap.packages] (installed by
# `dfm install mise` via `mise bootstrap packages apply`).
#
# What stays here on native brew, on purpose:
#   - casks (mise brew-cask cannot import, and its prune skips Homebrew-installed casks)
#   - imagemagick, ffmpeg, coreutils (GNU), and the two tap formulae
#   - gnupg and fontconfig, whose commands (gpg-agent, fc-list, fc-cache) this
#     repo calls directly
# Only leaves are listed: brew resolves each one's dependency closure, and a
# listed dependency is marked installed-on-request, so `brew autoremove` could
# never reclaim it.
# PHP is no longer managed here — phpenv.fish (homebrew provider) owns it.
# Applied with `dfm brew install` (brew bundle). Do not re-add the migrated
# formulae here — mise resolves their dependency closure automatically.
# Never run `mise bootstrap packages prune --manager brew`: it removes every
# formula mise config does not declare, this file's and phpenv's included.
tap "cormacrelf/tap"
tap "doron-cohen/tap"
# GNU File, Shell, and Text utilities
brew "coreutils"
# Play, record, convert, and stream select audio and video codecs
